\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Candidate D. Coupled reaction-diffusion systems\\n\\nFor \
example:\\n\\n$$\\\\frac{\\\\partial u}{\\\\partial t} = \
\\\\nabla\\\\cdot(d_u\\\\nabla u) + \
f_u(u,v,\\\\dots)$$\\n\\n$$\\\\frac{\\\\partial v}{\\\\partial t} = \\\\nabla\
